     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thought this seminar might be of interest to many of our D-RUG members: see below.<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: Theresa Garcia &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tga...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>Date: Tue, Sep 6, 2016 at 2:33 PM<br>Subject: FW: ANT298 seminar<br>To: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">biosci-a...@ucdavis.edu</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">biosci-a...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>Cc: Damien Caillaud &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dcai...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br></div><br><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">To ABGG Students<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Damien Caillaud\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, September 06, 2016 2:05 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> Theresa Garcia &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tga...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> ANT298 seminar<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi Theresa,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I am teaching a graduate seminar this fall, entitled “ANT 298: Modern tools for data collection, management and analysis”. I think 1st-2nd year ABGG students may be interested in attending it. Would you be able to forward the attached course\r\n description to the ABGG students? The CRN to enroll in the course is #22221. <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The students can email me directly if they have any question. <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Damien<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">------</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Damien Caillaud, DVM, PhD</span></b><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Assistant Professor</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Department of Anthropology</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">University of California, Davis</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">One Shields Ave.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Davis, CA 95616</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">USA</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNorm